garlands sold along the streets to locally made products and the city's annual Sampaguita Festival. Known as the \"Sampaguita Capital of the Philippines,\" the flower continues to shape the city&#39;s heritage and community pride.\r\n                ",[13298,13638],"\r\n                  Sampaguita has long been part of San Pedro's cultural and economic story—from garlands sold along the streets to locally made products and the city's annual Sampaguita Festival. Known as the \"Sampaguita Capital of the Philippines,\" the flower continues to shape the city&rsquo;s heritage and community pride.\r\n                ",[14223,14294],"Traditional sampaguita garlands remain iconic along San Pedro&apos;s streets",[14223,14294],"Traditional sampaguita garlands remain iconic along San Pedro&lsquo;s streets",[14223,14294],"Traditional sampaguita garlands remain iconic along San Pedro&#39;s streets",[14223,14294],"Traditional sampaguita garlands remain iconic along San Pedro&rsquo;s streets",[16872,17093],"\r\n              From old neighborhood panciterias to everyday merienda, San Pedro&apos;s food culture reflects its history as a close-knit community where tradition and flavor are passed down through generations.\r\n            ",[16872,17093],"\r\n              From old neighborhood panciterias to everyday merienda, San Pedro&lsquo;s food culture reflects its history as a close-knit community where tradition and flavor are passed down through generations.\r\n            ",[16872,17093],"\r\n              From old neighborhood panciterias to everyday merienda, San Pedro&#39;s food culture reflects its history as a close-knit community where tradition and flavor are passed down through generations.\r\n            ",[16872,17093],"\r\n              From old neighborhood panciterias to everyday merienda, San Pedro&rsquo;s food culture reflects its history as a close-knit community where tradition and flavor are passed down through generations.\r\n            ",[17859,18111],"\r\n                  A San Pedro institution dating back to the 1950s. Known for its distinctive noodles, egg, and ketchup/lechon-style toppings, Pancit Maciang represents the city&apos;s culinary heritage and neighborhood dining tradition.\r\n                ",[17859,18111],"\r\n                  A San Pedro institution dating back to the 1950s. Known for its distinctive noodles, egg, and ketchup/lechon-style toppings, Pancit Maciang represents the city&lsquo;s culinary heritage and neighborhood dining tradition.\r\n                ",[17859,18111],"\r\n                  A San Pedro institution dating back to the 1950s. Known for its distinctive noodles, egg, and ketchup/lechon-style toppings, Pancit Maciang represents the city&#39;s culinary heritage and neighborhood dining tradition.\r\n                ",[17859,18111],"\r\n                  A San Pedro institution dating back to the 1950s. Known for its distinctive noodles, egg, and ketchup/lechon-style toppings, Pancit Maciang represents the city&rsquo;s culinary heritage and neighborhood dining tradition.\r\n                ",[19126,19359],"\r\n                  Small, local noodle shops where families gather for quick meals and conversation. These humble establishments are the backbone of San Pedro&apos;s everyday food culture and community gathering spaces.\r\n                ",[19126,19359],"\r\n                  Small, local noodle shops where families gather for quick meals and conversation. These humble establishments are the backbone of San Pedro&lsquo;s everyday food culture and community gathering spaces.\r\n                ",[19126,19359],"\r\n                  Small, local noodle shops where families gather for quick meals and conversation. These humble establishments are the backbone of San Pedro&#39;s everyday food culture and community gathering spaces.\r\n                ",[19126,19359],"\r\n                  Small, local noodle shops where families gather for quick meals and conversation. These humble establishments are the backbone of San Pedro&rsquo;s everyday food culture and community gathering spaces.\r\n                ",[21501,21815],"\r\n                    The city&apos;s most significant celebration, dedicated to reviving and honoring San Pedro's sampaguita heritage. The festival features parades, cultural performances, local product showcases, and community gatherings that celebrate the flower that defines the city's identity.\r\n                  ",[21501,21815],"\r\n                    The city&lsquo;s most significant celebration, dedicated to reviving and honoring San Pedro's sampaguita heritage. The festival features parades, cultural performances, local product showcases, and community gatherings that celebrate the flower that defines the city's identity.\r\n                  ",[21501,21815],"\r\n                    The city&#39;s most significant celebration, dedicated to reviving and honoring San Pedro's sampaguita heritage. The festival features parades, cultural performances, local product showcases, and community gatherings that celebrate the flower that defines the city's identity.\r\n                  ",[21501,21815],"\r\n                    The city&rsquo;s most significant celebration, dedicated to reviving and honoring San Pedro's sampaguita heritage. The festival features parades, cultural performances, local product showcases, and community gatherings that celebrate the flower that defines the city's identity.\r\n                  ",[21501,21815],"\r\n                    The city's most significant celebration, dedicated to reviving and honoring San Pedro&apos;s sampaguita heritage. The festival features parades, cultural performances, local product showcases, and community gatherings that celebrate the flower that defines the city's identity.\r\n                  ",[21501,21815],"\r\n                    The city's most significant celebration, dedicated to reviving and honoring San Pedro&lsquo;s sampaguita heritage. The festival